# Findings scan.sh has surfaced that are accepted rather than scrubbed.
# One POSIX extended regex per line; matching sweep hits are ignored.

# The author's public email, used as a sqlite test fixture until Aug 2026
# (mike@example.com since) and present in commit authorship regardless.
^mra@xoba\.com$

# The author's home directory, mentioned in a comment of the original
# launcher script ("md", deleted May 2024); survives only in old commits.
^/Users/mra$
